{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Blend File Loading Pipeline.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Blend File Loading Pipeline.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender blend file loading pipeline blender blend file loading pipeline","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Blend File Loading Pipeline.md","fileName":"Blender Blend File Loading Pipeline.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Blend File Loading Pipeline","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender DNA and File Loading]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender DNA and File Loading","Blender Core Entry Point","Blender FileData Structure","Blender BlendFileData Structure","Blender LibBlock Linking","Blender Main Database","Blender Context Main Assignment","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Blend File Loading Pipeline.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Blend File Loading Pipeline.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender blend file loading pipeline blender blend file loading pipeline","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Blend File Loading Pipeline.md","fileName":"Blender Blend File Loading Pipeline.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Blend File Loading Pipeline","heading":"Blender Blend File Loading Pipeline","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Factory loading starts at the [[Blender Core Entry Point]], reaches `WM_init()`, and then follows `wm_homefile_read()`, `BKE_blendfile_read_from_memory()`, and `BLO_read_from_memory()`. The loader first creates a [[Blender FileData Structure]], validates the header and DNA, and then parses blocks through a common internal path.\n\nThat shared path produces a [[Blender BlendFileData Structure]] whether bytes came from memory or storage. [[Blender LibBlock Linking]] assembles its records into a [[Blender Main Database]], after which [[Blender Context Main Assignment]] makes the new state active.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender DNA and File Loading","Blender Core Entry Point","Blender FileData Structure","Blender BlendFileData Structure","Blender LibBlock Linking","Blender Main Database","Blender Context Main Assignment","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Blend File Loading Pipeline.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Blend File Loading Pipeline.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender blend file loading pipeline blender blend file loading pipeline","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Blend File Loading Pipeline.md","fileName":"Blender Blend File Loading Pipeline.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Blend File Loading Pipeline","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender DNA and File Loading","Blender Core Entry Point","Blender FileData Structure","Blender BlendFileData Structure","Blender LibBlock Linking","Blender Main Database","Blender Context Main Assignment","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}